{"3656600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chort", "steam_appid": 3656600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHORT. Abandoned. Betrayed. Deceived.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once feared, now broken, Chort is cast down and left with nothing but hatred and lust for power burning in his chest. Defeated by a whispering witch, he is torn from his dominion and forced back into the world of the living. But death does not end his story. Driven by vengeance and obsession, Chort rises again to follow the trail of the one bound to him by fate — the girl who was meant to be his. Step by step, through dark lands and forgotten paths, he hunts her shadow, slowly reclaiming fragments of his lost power. Hatred guides him. Desire fuels him. And with every step closer to his chosen one, his true nature begins to awaken once more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656600/extras/b519d25019f0f2980ea437fd2c732302.poster.avif?t=1785523529\" width=600 height=1080 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656600/extras/b519d25019f0f2980ea437fd2c732302.webm?t=1785523529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656600/extras/b519d25019f0f2980ea437fd2c732302.mp4?t=1785523529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world struggling for identity in the wake of absent gods.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world filled with mysticism, magic and taboo, where no deed goes without a ripple in the fabric of reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world of magical barter between humans and creatures dwelling in the wild.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world in which humanity is merely a barely tolerated guest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exploring the narrative</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time waits for none…</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider the bigger picture;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand the sides of conflict and choose one of them;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capitalize on your gains and advantages;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build renown, expand your asset base and  forge a following;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live, learn, die, repeat - the end is never the end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Short term immediate action</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your survival is a primary requisite for anything</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyse  the surroundings;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify the threats and resources;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plot your route and approach;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neutralize or avoid the threat;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract the value;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your luck - you are always on borrowed time, the longer you explore, the more combat awaits;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the advantage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematically guided camera &amp; storytelling,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat system - easy to master and extremely impressive,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depth based exploration, promoting curiosity and stealth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic, deadly, “easy to learn - hard to master” combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging environment-based puzzles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The vibe</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patience and observation interspersed with intense struggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill rewarding experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtful analysis of our choice's ramifications</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unending joy of finding a novel approach to a problem</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHORT. Abandoned. Betrayed. Deceived.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once feared, now broken, Chort is cast down and left with nothing but hatred and lust for power burning in his chest. Defeated by a whispering witch, he is torn from his dominion and forced back into the world of the living. But death does not end his story. Driven by vengeance and obsession, Chort rises again to follow the trail of the one bound to him by fate — the girl who was meant to be his. Step by step, through dark lands and forgotten paths, he hunts her shadow, slowly reclaiming fragments of his lost power. Hatred guides him. Desire fuels him. And with every step closer to his chosen one, his true nature begins to awaken once more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656600/extras/b519d25019f0f2980ea437fd2c732302.poster.avif?t=1785523529\" width=600 height=1080 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/