e or avoid the threat;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract the value;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your luck - you are always on borrowed time, the longer you explore, the more combat awaits;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the advantage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematically guided camera &amp; storytelling,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat system - easy to master and extremely impressive,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depth based exploration, promoting curiosity and stealth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic, deadly, “easy to learn - hard to master” combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging environment-based puzzles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The vibe</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patience and observation interspersed with intense struggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill rewarding experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtful analysis of our choice's ramifications</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unending joy of finding a novel approach to a problem</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p>", "short_description": "A 2.5D dark-fantasy action - adventure where you are the monster. Slain by a witch's curse, the demon Chort claws his way back from death to hunt the girl bound to him by fate - reclaiming his lost power piece by piece. Slavic folk horror from the age when the old gods went silent.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656600/3937f31acb9992892bb957e45103e73cf87ce837/header.jpg?t=178